# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MetaGatherer — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Facebook Graph API access token (REQUIRED)
#
# How to get one (easiest method):
#
#   1. Go to: https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/
#   2. Select or create an app (any type — "Consumer" works fine).
#   3. Click "Generate Access Token".
#   4. Add the permission:  ads_read
#      (also add: pages_read_engagement if you want page follower data)
#   5. Click "Generate Token" → copy the token below.
#
# NOTE: User tokens expire after ~60 days. For longer-lived tokens:
#   - Use the Access Token Debugger to extend to 60-day tokens.
#   - Or use an App Access Token (App ID|App Secret) — note this has lower
#     rate limits and may not expose all ad fields.
#
# The Ads Library API is subject to Meta's Terms of Service:
# https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/api/

FB_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token_here

# Optional: Claude API key for AI-powered keyword expansion.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/
# Without this, the tool falls back to frequency-based keyword extraction.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Optional: Discord webhook URL for winner notifications.
# Create one at: Server Settings > Integrations > Webhooks > New Webhook
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=your_discord_webhook_url_here
